    "claim": "The nebula library (mraiser/newbound_nebula, store v42) is four controls: `nebula` carries the app UI and all 14 rust commands; `lighthouse`, `network`, `member` are popup forms only. The 14 commands split into release management (info, install_release), CA/certs (create_network, add_member), rollout (join_network executed on the remote peer via the send_*(..., target) peer proxy, members), config rendering (save_config, build_config — duplicated YAML template), and systemd control (install/uninstall/start/stop/restart_service); convert_legacy is a dead stub.",
